[dashboard] endpoint ws+unix:///Users/robson/.pi/dashboard/gateway-9999.sock:/ (source=PI_DASHBOARD_SOCKET pinned=true)
[dashboard] sendFlowsList: 0 flows, sessionId=01a0a280
